@startuml
title ASCS Role and Responsibility Boundaries
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #334155

rectangle "Student\nSubmit / track / print approved record" as Student #E0F2FE
rectangle "Clearance Signatories\nLibrarian\nOSA Coordinator\nGuidance Counselor\nArea Chair\nDean" as Signatories #E0F2FE
rectangle "Accountant\nFinancial gate" as Accountant #FEF3C7
rectangle "Dean\nFinal clearance signatory\nAcademic reports" as Dean #F3E8FF
rectangle "System Administrator\nAccounts / assignments / reports / logs" as Admin #F1F5F9
rectangle "ASCS\nRole-scoped actions" as ASCS #DBEAFE

Student --> ASCS
Signatories --> ASCS
Accountant --> ASCS
Dean --> ASCS
Admin --> ASCS

note right of Accountant
Not a duplicate approval row.
Updates financialStatus.
end note

note right of Dean
Reviews and approves Dean Clearance.
Reports remain available separately.
end note

note bottom of Signatories
The active signatory matrix contains
exactly five roles, including Dean.
end note
@enduml
